{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerator Operator is cash chasing roguelike where you harness the power of the atom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch  neutrons to create a chain reaction splitting materials into more neutrons. The more neutrons the more money made!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different materials have vastly different effects when hit:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fissile materials will make more neutrons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiply neutrons and redirect them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase profits of neutrons!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain perks with powerful synergies that gives you a unique experience every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges, starting materials, and persistent unlocks will make sure the experience always feels fresh and give a harder challenge for those who seek it.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Casual Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932160/1b234b215a85daac5f39fc77f7d78fbc416fe606.jpg"},{"name":"Normal Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932160/1b234b215a85daac5f39fc77f7d78fbc416fe606.jpg"},{"name":"Hard Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932160/1b234b215a85daac5f39fc77f7d78fbc416fe606.jpg"},{"name":"Zenith Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932160/1b234b215a85daac5f39fc77f7d78fbc416fe606.jpg"},{"name":"Beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932160/1b234b215a85daac5f39fc77f7d78fbc416fe606.jpg"},{"name":"Improvement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3932160/1b234b215a85daa